<title>USA: USDA releases $50 mln more to Pakistan in GSM-102.</title>
<headline>USDA releases $50 mln more to Pakistan in GSM-102.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Friday said it released an additional $50 million in short-term GSM-102 export credit guarantees to Pakistan for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>With the step, Pakistan received $174 million of the $250 million earmarked for it this fiscal year.</p>
</text>
